        {
          "text": " MUKAMA aryagirira Yakobo esaasi, kandi aryagaruka atoorane Abaisraeli, abagarure omu nsi yaabo; n'abanyamahanga baryaija beeteerane nabo, beekome aha nju ya Yakobo. ",
