          "text": " Kandi abanyamahanga baryabatwara, babahitsye owaabo, ab'enju ya Israeli baryabahakira omu nsi ya MUKAMA, babagire abahuuku n'abazaana; baryatwara omu bukwatwa abo abaabaire babatwaire omu bukwatwa, kandi baryategyeka abaabaire babatwaza eikama.",
